  "award_descriptions": {
    "mvp": "Biggest gap over his own position group, weighted by the share of his team's weekly points he carried — a QB has to beat the QB field, not just outscore a tight end. Skill positions only, regular season only, weeks 1–13.",
    "letty_ortiz_award": "Most points scored across the season, whatever the win-loss record says. Regular season only, weeks 1–13.",
